          "date": "2026-11-11 02:14:33.000000000",
          "tz": 600
        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_declare_layout_merge",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_declare_layout_merge\n\nAdd lod_merge_test.ko, exercising lod_declare_layout_merge(): appending\na freshly-read on-disk lov_comp_md_v1 layout as a new FLR mirror,\nrenumbering ids via pflr_id(), flagging new components stale as\nrequested, and declaring the merged LOVEA. Components stay\nun-instantiated, so a mock_ost_obj and a trivial thandle (th_top ==\nNULL) stand in for a real OST/OSP. Also covers lod_layout_convert()\n(wrapping a plain lov_mds_md in a single-component lov_comp_md_v1\nenvelope), lod_layout_repeat_comp() (duplicating a PFL component into\na new zero-length un-inited slot), and lod_comp_copy_ost_lists()\n(copying a user OST list into lod_layout_component::llc_ostlist).\n\nExport lod_declare_layout_merge(), lod_layout_convert(),\nlod_layout_repeat_comp() and lod_comp_copy_ost_lists() for this test.\nAlso make mock_ost's do_declare_xattr_set() deep-copy the declared\nxattr instead of saving it by pointer, since callers free their\nscratch buffer right after declaring, which left mo_last_declare_buf\ndangling.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Augment Agent <agent@augmentcode.com>\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I5e7b4c0cea3de4ce3e82ccf8fd161e9be1d01820\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
